    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kaskade is a minimalist strategy game about connecting an evolving delivery network. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285530/extras/b2cb90f9e3d52d4989979faa22a8d544.poster.avif?t=1750856296\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285530/extras/b2cb90f9e3d52d4989979faa22a8d544.webm?t=1750856296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285530/extras/b2cb90f9e3d52d4989979faa22a8d544.mp4?t=1750856296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Connect inputs to outputs that match in color to earn credits. Spend credits to unlock new abilities. Use those new abilities to make managing your network more effective. Rinse and repeat.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285530/extras/f9795112654dc49c643daee175a74597.poster.avif?t=1750856296\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285530/extras/f9795112654dc49c643daee175a74597.webm?t=1750856296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285530/extras/f9795112654dc49c643daee175a74597.mp4?t=1750856296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permadeath!\u00a0Too many false moves and it will be game over! There is no save system, but there is roguelite progression between runs.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285530/extras/0894e47d6980bd3c9173e065968517e6.poster.avif?t=1750856296\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285530/extras/0894e47d6980bd3c9173e065968517e6.webm?t=1750856296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285530/extras/0894e47d6980bd3c9173e065968517e6.mp4?t=1750856296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A zen, puzzle experience or a strategic, roguelite challenge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 Chapters with unique mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three game modes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Normal for the classic Kaskade experience,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infinite for stress-free sandbox play,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hard for a serious challenge</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key abilities to unlock (Jump, Double Jump, Switch, Compact, and Pause)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boons and upgrades to purchase to manage more and more deliveries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorblind mode (deliveries have clear labels)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse and keyboard support (gamepads are not recommended)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kaskade is a minimalist strategy game about connecting an evolving delivery network. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285530/extras/b2cb90f9e3d52d4989979faa22a8d544.poster.avif?t=1750856296\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285530/extras/b2cb90f9e3d52d4989979faa22a8d544.webm?t=1750856296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285530/extras/b2cb90f9e3d52d4989979faa22a8d544.mp4?t=1750856296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Connect inputs to outputs that match in color to earn credits. Spend credits to unlock new abilities. Use those new abilities to make managing your network more effective. Rinse and repeat.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285530/extras/f9795112654dc49c643daee175a74597.poster.avif?t=1750856296\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285530/extras/f9795112654dc49c643daee175a74597.webm?t=1750856296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285530/extras/f9795112654dc49c643daee175a74597.mp4?t=1750856296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permadeath!\u00a0Too many false moves and it will be game over! There is no save system, but there is roguelite progression between runs.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285530/extras/0894e47d6980bd3c9173e065968517e6.poster.avif?t=1750856296\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285530/extras/0894e47d6980bd3c9173e065968517e6.webm?t=1750856296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285530/extras/0894e47d6980bd3c9173e065968517e6.mp4?t=1750856296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A zen, puzzle experience or a strategic, roguelite challenge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 Chapters with unique mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three game modes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Normal for the classic Kaskade experience,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infinite for stress-free sandbox play,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hard for a serious challenge</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key abilities to unlock (Jump, Double Jump, Switch, Compact, and Pause)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boons and upgrades to purchase to manage more and more deliveries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorblind mode (deliveries have clear labels)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse and keyboard support (gamepads are not recommended)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Connect an evolving delivery network in Kaskade, a minimalist strategy game. Construct intricate paths to ensure each delivery gets to the right destination. Unlock upgrades to manage the increasing complexity as your network grows. Relax to the ambient soundtrack and the satisfying puzzle vibes.",
